<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summoning Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the summoning sphere call things from elsewhere and send things away: the conjurers' elementals, demons and devils, the gates, portals and teleports that carry you across the world, the recalls that bring you home, and the druids' and rangers' forces of nature. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist summoning spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level):
</p>
<pre>dust devil            conjurer 9
random teleport       conjurer 22
clear skies           healer 33, druid 43
storm call            conjurer 12
word of recall        healer 10
controlled teleport   conjurer 35
minor gate            conjurer 27, sorcerer 30
gate                  conjurer 35
leaving               conjurer 8
transport             conjurer 17, sorcerer 32
shard breath          no guild teaches it
cone of shards        conjurer 32
meteor shower         no guild teaches it
total recall          healer 20
undead door           necromancer 25
clenched fist         conjurer 13
energy bolt           conjurer 0
summon devil          conjurer 50
summon demon          conjurer 40
summon fire           conjurer 30
summon water          conjurer 24
summon air            conjurer 18
summon earth          conjurer 14
sending               sorcerer 15
banish                no guild teaches it
cause instability     no guild teaches it
summon animal         ranger 40
eagle cry             ranger 29
tiger claw            ranger 21
group teleport        conjurer 130
soul shift            no guild teaches it
portal                sorcerer 120
travel                sorcerer 150
tsunami               druid 52
hedge wall            druid 21
thorn strike          druid 2
wind slash            druid 10
summon lightning      druid 60
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
